# P-006-9: CSS Paged Media 3 in servo mode (ui4me 015 PAGE-1, register UP-13; lane L-PAGE, AUTHORISATIONS E-029): `@page` parsed behind the new static pref `layout.css.page-rule.enabled` (default false) instead of `cfg!(feature = "gecko")`; the 16 page-margin at-rules parsed in servo mode behind the existing pref `layout.css.margin-rules.enabled`; the page context and the margin boxes accept every property a style rule accepts (CSS Paged Media 3 sections 3.2 and 5.3); the `size` descriptor and the `page` property become servo-mode longhands, kept in the existing `box` struct (no new ComputedValues field, size test unchanged); `BreakBetween` gains `recto` and `verso` (CSS Break 3 section 3.1; not valid in the legacy `page-break-*`)
# Applies to: servo/stylo @ 37c1ed3b707c8f333304de2107c13b68fbc1057c after P-006-1 .. P-006-8 (root of the checkout, `patch -p1`)
# Licence: MPL-2.0 (modifications to MPL-2.0 files; the modified source is published with the repository, see engine/NOTICE)

